	//mp_ability_rocket_ribault (Fire a rocket propelled fire bomb. Press %offhand4% to air burst the bomb and drop fire mines.)
	//grenade_molotov (Throw a fire bomb that sets enemies on fire.)
	//deployable_molotov (Drop a box of 4 molotovs anyone in your squad can pickup and throw.)
	//Passive Fire Walker (You automatically extinguish fire by walking through it. Burning teammates will be extinguished when they move close to you.)
	
	//Inmortal
	//Shield carger (Unleash a cloud of nanites to charge your teams shields.)
	//Protection (Restores your health and shields to full and gives nearby teammates 30 seconds of self revive. Takes 8 seconds to charge.)

